ssues or pull requests related to the change\n-issues: [1722]\n-\n-# (Optional) One or more lines of additional information to render under the primary note.\n-# These lines will be padded with 2 spaces and then inserted directly into the document.\n-# Use pipe (|) for multiline entries.\n-subtext: |\n-  Go 1.26.10 includes the `crypto/x509` security fixes released on 2026-10-19.\n-  The updated CA bundle removes the distrusted eMudhra emSign roots, including `emSign ECC Root CA - G3`.\n-\n-# Optional: The change log or logs in which this entry should be included.\n-# e.g. '[user]' or '[user, api]'\n-# Include 'user' if the change is relevant to end users.\n-# Include 'api' if there is a change to a library API.\n-# Default: '[user]'\n-change_logs: [user]"},{"sha":"7072f6edd393266d54504a32b7eedfb8716ccb47","filename":"CHANGELOG.md","status":"modified","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-releases/blob/6c65793ec707f673304e52dfcb642684fda1a048/CHANGELOG.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-releases/raw/6c65793ec707f673304e52dfcb642684fda1a048/CHANGELOG.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-releases/contents/CHANGELOG.md?ref=6c65793ec707f673304e52dfcb642684fda1a048","patch":"@@ -4,6 +4,15 @@\n \n <!-- next version -->\n \n+## v0.163.2\n+\n+### 🧰 Bug fixes 🧰\n+\n+- `all`: Build release binaries with Go 1.26.10 and require Alpine `ca-certificates` 20261020-r0 or later in container images. (#1722)\n+  Go 1.26.10 includes the `crypto/x509` security fixes released on 2026-10-19.\n+  The updated CA bundle removes the distrusted eMudhra emSign roots, including `emSign ECC Root CA - G3`.\n+  \n+\n ## v0.163.1\n \n ## v0.163.0"},{"sha":"50a06660f707b9b35687ed5599dcc2c9366ad838","filename":"distributions/otelcol-contrib/manifest.yaml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.co